Intended use
------------

This diagram is intended to show what Chla looks like, and here we use TRESP coupling as an example. Of course, other coupling schemes can also be used.

How to use
----------
The method of running is very simple. You only need to clone this branch and quickly get the corresponding map through GMAP. It should be noted that this requires the corresponding dynamic structure

